change('main',r'If $V^+-V^-\le\varepsilon$, its retained count is within $\varepsilon$ outputs of $V^*$. These are deterministic finite-family statements and hold for any acquisition order or stopping time.',r'If $V^+-V^-\le\varepsilon$, its returned count is at most $\varepsilon$ outputs below $V^*$. These deterministic guarantees hold for every acquisition order and stopping time within the declared family.',[41])
